    <item>
      <title>Call for Papers</title>
      <link>https://huntcon.github.io/cfp/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://huntcon.github.io/cfp/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;We invite security professionals, researchers, and practitioners to submit presentations on threat hunting topics.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;form id=&#34;cfp-form&#34; action=&#34;https://formspree.io/f/placeholder&#34; method=&#34;POST&#34; enctype=&#34;multipart/form-data&#34; class=&#34;mt-8 space-y-6 max-w-2xl&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;affiliation&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Affiliation (Company) &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;affiliation&#34; name=&#34;affiliation&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;fieldset class=&#34;border border-neutral-700 rounded-lg p-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;legend class=&#34;text-sm font-semibold px-2&#34;&gt;Primary Speaker &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/legend&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;primary-first&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;First Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;primary-first&#34; name=&#34;primary_first_name&#34; required&#xA;          class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;primary-last&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Last Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;primary-last&#34; name=&#34;primary_last_name&#34; required&#xA;          class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;mt-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;primary-email&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Email &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;primary-email&#34; name=&#34;primary_email&#34; required&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/fieldset&gt;&#xA;  &lt;fieldset class=&#34;border border-neutral-700 rounded-lg p-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;legend class=&#34;text-sm font-semibold px-2&#34;&gt;Secondary Speaker (Optional)&lt;/legend&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;secondary-first&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;First Name&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;secondary-first&#34; name=&#34;secondary_first_name&#34;&#xA;          class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;label for=&#34;secondary-last&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Last Name&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;secondary-last&#34; name=&#34;secondary_last_name&#34;&#xA;          class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;mt-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;secondary-email&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Email&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;secondary-email&#34; name=&#34;secondary_email&#34;&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/fieldset&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;title&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Presentation Title &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;title&#34; name=&#34;presentation_title&#34; required maxlength=&#34;100&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-1&#34;&gt;Maximum 100 characters&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Contact</title>
      <link>https://huntcon.github.io/contact/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://huntcon.github.io/contact/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Have questions about HUNTCON 2027? Reach out to us using the form below.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;form id=&#34;contact-form&#34; action=&#34;https://formspree.io/f/placeholder&#34; method=&#34;POST&#34; class=&#34;mt-8 space-y-6 max-w-2xl&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;input type=&#34;hidden&#34; name=&#34;_to&#34; value=&#34;sebastien.damaye@se.com&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;contact-first&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;First Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;contact-first&#34; name=&#34;first_name&#34; required&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;contact-last&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Last Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;contact-last&#34; name=&#34;last_name&#34; required&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;contact-email&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Email &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;contact-email&#34; name=&#34;email&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;contact-subject&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Subject &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;contact-subject&#34; name=&#34;subject&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;contact-message&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Message &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;textarea id=&#34;contact-message&#34; name=&#34;message&#34; required rows=&#34;6&#34;&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34;&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;button type=&#34;submit&#34;&#xA;class=&#34;px-8 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-violet-600 text-white font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity cursor-pointer&#34;&gt;&#xA;Send Message&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Info</title>
      <link>https://huntcon.github.io/info/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://huntcon.github.io/info/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Venue&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;venue&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#venue&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUNTCON 2027&lt;/strong&gt; takes place at &lt;strong&gt;EDENN&lt;/strong&gt;, the new Schneider Electric headquarters.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Address:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;1884 Boulevard de La Défense&lt;br&gt;&#xA;92000 Nanterre, France&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;How to Get There&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;how-to-get-there&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#how-to-get-there&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;By Metro / RER&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;by-metro--rer&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#by-metro--rer&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RER A&lt;/strong&gt; — Station &lt;em&gt;La Défense (Grande Arche)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;From central Paris, take RER A westbound. The venue is a short walk from the station.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Registration</title>
      <link>https://huntcon.github.io/registration/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://huntcon.github.io/registration/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Register to attend HUNTCON 2027. Participation is free but registration is mandatory.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;form id=&#34;registration-form&#34; action=&#34;https://formspree.io/f/placeholder&#34; method=&#34;POST&#34; class=&#34;mt-8 space-y-6 max-w-2xl&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;reg-affiliation&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Affiliation (Company) &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;reg-affiliation&#34; name=&#34;affiliation&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;reg-first&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;First Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;reg-first&#34; name=&#34;first_name&#34; required&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;reg-last&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Last Name &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;reg-last&#34; name=&#34;last_name&#34; required&#xA;        class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label for=&#34;reg-email&#34; class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-1&#34;&gt;Email &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;reg-email&#34; name=&#34;email&#34; required&#xA;      class=&#34;w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 text-neutral-100 focus:border-cyan-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-500 outline-none&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-2&#34;&gt;Participation Mode &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;space-y-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label class=&#34;flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;radio&#34; name=&#34;mode&#34; value=&#34;attendee&#34; required&#xA;          class=&#34;text-cyan-500 focus:ring-cyan-500&#34; onchange=&#34;toggleTopics()&#34; checked /&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span&gt;Attendee only&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label class=&#34;flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;radio&#34; name=&#34;mode&#34; value=&#34;round_table&#34; required&#xA;          class=&#34;text-cyan-500 focus:ring-cyan-500&#34; onchange=&#34;toggleTopics()&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span&gt;Participant to a Round Table&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&#34;topics-section&#34; class=&#34;hidden border border-neutral-700 rounded-lg p-4&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;label class=&#34;block text-sm font-medium mb-2&#34;&gt;Round Table Topics &lt;span class=&#34;text-red-400&#34;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;text-xs text-neutral-500&#34;&gt;(select at least one)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;space-y-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label class=&#34;flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; name=&#34;topics&#34; value=&#34;threat_hunting_frameworks&#34;&#xA;          class=&#34;text-cyan-500 focus:ring-cyan-500 rounded&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span&gt;Threat Hunting Frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label class=&#34;flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; name=&#34;topics&#34; value=&#34;ai_threat_hunting&#34;&#xA;          class=&#34;text-cyan-500 focus:ring-cyan-500 rounded&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span&gt;AI Applied to Threat Hunting&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label class=&#34;flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;input type=&#34;checkbox&#34; name=&#34;topics&#34; value=&#34;vibe_hunting&#34;&#xA;          class=&#34;text-cyan-500 focus:ring-cyan-500 rounded&#34; /&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span&gt;Vibe Hunting&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/label&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;button type=&#34;submit&#34;&#xA;class=&#34;px-8 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-violet-600 text-white font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity cursor-pointer&#34;&gt;&#xA;Register&#xA;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
  </channel>
